{"id":"29f67a62b22dd6a8","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws.md","title":"停机前缀的概率一致性","display":"thm-random-prefix-probability-laws — 停机前缀的概率一致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws","aliases":["73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws"],"display":"thm-random-prefix-probability-laws — 停机前缀的概率一致性","depends_on":["[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.3 and proof of Theorem 11.17, print pp. 505, 510–511; PDF pp. 527, 532–533; local finite-prefix proof","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random-prefix-probability-laws — 停机前缀的概率一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"49440e374bb38c72\" href=\"?note=49440e374bb38c72\" title=\"73-df-random-acceptance-probability\">73-df-random-acceptance-probability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.3 and proof of Theorem 11.17, print pp. 505, 510–511; PDF pp. 527, 532–533; local finite-prefix proof"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HP},H,\\Pr^a,\\Pr^r,\\mathbb E\">\\(\\operatorname{HP},H,\\Pr^a,\\Pr^r,\\mathbb E\\)</span> 见已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{HP}_{M,w}\\;\\bigl[(\\exists z\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;uz=v)\\Longrightarrow u=v\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{HP}_{M,w}\\;\\bigl[(\\exists z\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;uz=v)\\Longrightarrow u=v\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\le t\\Longrightarrow0\\le H_{M,w}(s)\\le H_{M,w}(t)\\le1,\\qquad\n0\\le\\Pr_M^a(w)+\\Pr_M^r(w)\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\le t\\Longrightarrow0\\le H_{M,w}(s)\\le H_{M,w}(t)\\le1,\\qquad\n0\\le\\Pr_M^a(w)+\\Pr_M^r(w)\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_M(w)&lt;+\\infty\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)+\\Pr_M^r(w)=1,\\qquad\n1-H_{M,w}(t)\\le\\frac{\\mathbb E_M(w)}{t+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb E_M(w)&lt;+\\infty\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)+\\Pr_M^r(w)=1,\\qquad\n1-H_{M,w}(t)\\le\\frac{\\mathbb E_M(w)}{t+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若停机前缀是真前缀，后一个运行将在已无后继的终态继续，矛盾。把每个长度≤t 的停机前缀补齐到 t 位，得到互不相交的有限集合，证明权重和≤1。尾概率单调；前 t+1 项都不小于第 t 项，得尾界。期望有限迫使尾概率趋零，故以概率 1 停机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-acceptance-probability","status":"resolved","id":"49440e374bb38c72","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HP},H,\\Pr^a,\\Pr^r,\\mathbb E","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{HP}_{M,w}\\;\\bigl[(\\exists z\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;uz=v)\\Longrightarrow u=v\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"s\\le t\\Longrightarrow0\\le H_{M,w}(s)\\le H_{M,w}(t)\\le1,\\qquad\n0\\le\\Pr_M^a(w)+\\Pr_M^r(w)\\le1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_M(w)<+\\infty\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)+\\Pr_M^r(w)=1,\\qquad\n1-H_{M,w}(t)\\le\\frac{\\mathbb E_M(w)}{t+1}.","display":true}],"bytes":1644,"backlinks":[{"id":"1c185b4536ca59db","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2768770bc528cab8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws|停机前缀的概率一致性]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"0afef8eeccddc023","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["49440e374bb38c72"]}